# The likeliest weak point is "generated from": for comparatives (greater/less) it means one subject passing from one state to the other, while life/death are states. But P3 only applies the general claim of P1 to a case, so each claim keeps one sense across its statements.
opposites_generated	one
life_death_opposites	one
mutual_generation	one
living_from_dead	one
